#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.reshape.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.reshape"
msgstr "cuda.tile.reshape"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reshape:1 of
msgid "Reshapes a tile to the specified shape."
msgstr "将 Tile 重塑（reshape）为指定形状。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reshape:3 of
msgid ""
"One of the shape elements may be specified as -1 to indicate that the "
"corresponding dimension is to be inferred automatically."
msgstr "可将形状中的一个元素指定为 -1，表示自动推断该维度的大小。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.reshape:6 of
msgid ""
"For example, reshaping a ``(16, 2)`` tile to ``(8, -1)`` will produce a "
"tile of shape ``(8, 4)``: as there are 32 elements in total, the second "
"dimension will be computed as 32 divided by 8."
msgstr ""
"例如，将形状为 ``(16, 2)`` 的 Tile 重塑为 ``(8, -1)`` 将得到形状为 ``(8, 4)`` 的 Tile：由于总共有"
" 32 个元素，第二维将通过 32 除以 8 自动计算得出。"

